OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1783691323
OL,3,CJordan Henderson set to miss rest of
OL,4,CWorld Cup after serious wrist injury
OL,6,FEngland player Jordan Henderson is
OL,7,Fexpected to miss the rest of the Three
OL,8,FLions 2026 World Cup campaign after
OL,9,Fseriously injuring his wrist while
OL,10,Fcelebrating the team's win over Mexico.
OL,12,FThe unused substitute took a nasty
OL,13,Ffall after jumping over an advertising
OL,14,Fboard following England's singalong
OL,15,Fwith fans to Oasis' Wonderwall and
OL,16,Fleft the field on a stretcher.
OL,18,FHenderson was taken to a hospital in
OL,19,FMexico City.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
