PN,31902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1783691323
OL,3,CJordan Henderson set to miss rest of
OL,4,CWorld Cup after serious wrist injury
OL,6,FIt was later confirmed the former
OL,7,FLiverpool captain would not return to
OL,8,FKansas City with the rest of the squad
OL,9,Fon Sunday evening as he continued to
OL,10,Freceive medical treatment.
OL,12,FAlthough there was no official
OL,13,Fstatement from the Football
OL,14,FAssociation about Henderson's
OL,15,Fcondition, several reports suggest he
OL,16,Fhas been ruled out of any future World
OL,17,FCup games.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
