CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1783691323
OL,3,CJordan Henderson set to miss rest of
OL,4,CWorld Cup after serious wrist injury
OL,6,FFollowing his side's 3-2 victory in
OL,7,Fthe early hours of Monday, England
OL,8,Fboss Thomas Tuchel said: "He injured
OL,9,Fhis wrist. He is at the moment at the
OL,10,Fhospital, so it is quite a serious
OL,11,Finjury.
OL,13,F"It just doesn't fit to the evening
OL,14,Fthat Jordan is now not with us. I
OL,15,Fdon't know the procedure what is going
OL,16,Fon. I just did the press, and the doc
OL,17,Ftold me he's in hospital."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
