PN,31904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1783691323
OL,3,CJordan Henderson set to miss rest of
OL,4,CWorld Cup after serious wrist injury
OL,6,FThe Brentford midfielder's 2026 World
OL,7,FCup campaign was limited to a six-
OL,8,Fminute appearance at the end of the
OL,9,FThree Lions' win over Panama during
OL,10,Fthe group stage.
OL,12,FEngland's win over Mexico City will
OL,13,Fsee them take on Norway in Miami in
OL,14,Fthe quarter-final on Saturday at 10pm
OL,15,FBST.
OL,17,FHenderson's injury on Monday was a
OL,18,Fdisappointing moment on a night that
OL,19,Fwill live long in the memory for all
OL,20,Finvolved at the Azteca.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
