PN,31905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1783691323
OL,3,CJordan Henderson set to miss rest of
OL,4,CWorld Cup after serious wrist injury
OL,6,FFrom playing at altitude in front of a
OL,7,Fraucous crowd and Jarell Quansah's red
OL,8,Fcard to a delayed kick-off, England
OL,9,Fhad to overcome all manner of
OL,10,Fobstacles against the World Cup co-
OL,11,Fhosts.
OL,13,FMexico had only lost two of their
OL,14,Fprevious 89 competitive matches at the
OL,15,FAzteca.
OL,17,F"In the build-up, it never felt like a
OL,18,Fround of 16," Tuchel said. "It still
OL,19,Fnow doesn't feel like a round of 16.
OL,20,FIt feels almost like we won a final or
OL,21,Fsomething.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,320,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1783691323
OL,3,CJordan Henderson set to miss rest of
OL,4,CWorld Cup after serious wrist injury
OL,6,F"This last moment where the referee
OL,7,Ftakes the whistle to his mouth, and
OL,8,Fyou know that you overcame 40-50
OL,9,Fminutes with 10 men in the altitude
OL,10,Fagainst the home country, against a
OL,11,Fstrong, strong Mexican team. This is a
OL,12,Fmoment of joy.
OL,14,F"It is a heroic performance and a
OL,15,Fheroic result in the end. I'm so happy
OL,16,Ffor the players. It ranks on the very,
OL,17,Fvery highest level, of course, also
OL,18,Ffor me to be part of this.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,320,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1783691323
OL,3,CJordan Henderson set to miss rest of
OL,4,CWorld Cup after serious wrist injury
OL,6,F"To live this experience the last two
OL,7,Fdays, to be in this country, to see
OL,8,Fthe people on the side of the streets
OL,9,Fall the way to the stadium, such, such
OL,10,Fspecial moments.
OL,12,F"And to overcome it against all
OL,13,Fadversity, makes it very special and
OL,14,Fit will have a very special place for
OL,15,Fall of us."
